      "Anthropic is pursuing its first direct data center leases in the United States, signing more than a dozen preliminary agreements for facilities with combined capacity exceeding 1 gigawatt, according to The Information. The company is also discussing an arrangement in which Google would provide financial backing for the lease payments.",
