      "A gigawatt-plus leasing pipeline puts Anthropic in the same capacity bracket as hyperscalers and major power consumers. For context, that is roughly the output of a large nuclear plant, enough to influence the same site selection, power procurement, and interconnection markets tracked by data center operators and energy-intensive industries.",
